Column name: program_name Type: STRING Description: Program name, eg TCGA or TARGET
Column name: project_id Type: STRING Description: ID of the Project -- e.g. TCGA-BRCA, TARGET-AML, etc.
Column name: case_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: GDC unique identifier
Column name: case_barcode Type: STRING Description: Submitter identifier, eg HCC1954, TCGA-ZX-AA5X, etc
Column name: sample_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: Unique GDC identifier for this sample (corresponds to the sample_barcode), eg a1ec9279-c1a6-4e58-97ed-9ec1f36187c5  --  this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal
Column name: sample_barcode Type: STRING Description: Original/submitter sample ID
Column name: sample_type Type: STRING Description: Two-digit sample_type code which forms part of the sample barcode eg. 01,11,06, etc.
Column name: sample_type_name Type: STRING Description: The longer name of the sample type; eg. Primary Tumor, Recurrent Tumor, etc.
Column name: sample_is_ffpe Type: STRING Description: Whether a smaple is FFPE, either  False,  None ,  True, or null
Column name: sample_preservation_method Type: STRING Description: Sample Preservation Method, usually null or  FFPE, also Snap Frozen or Frozen
Column name: portion_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: Portion GDC ID
Column name: portion_barcode Type: STRING Description: Original/submitter portion ID
Column name: analyte_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: Analyte GDC ID
Column name: analyte_barcode Type: STRING Description: Original/submitter analyte ID
Column name: aliquot_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: Unique GDC identifier for this aliquot (corresponds to the aliquot_barcode), eg 7fbfdb3e-1fd2-4206-8d2e-7f68e4a15844  --  this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal
Column name: aliquot_barcode Type: STRING Description: Original TCGA aliquot barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A-01D-0517-01
