Begin Exploring Related Columns
Below are the main columns that will be useful together with the way we shall use them and the filters that make sense for this task.

•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Annotations.entity_type` : identify annotations that were created at the “Patient” (== Case) level  
•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Annotations.category` / `classification` : decide whether a patient is flagged (“History of unacceptable prior treatment …”, or any “Redaction”)  
•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Annotations.entity_barcode` : the TCGA case barcode we will join on (same as `case_barcode` in Clinical)  
•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Annotations.case_gdc_id` : UUID for the case – usable for joins to GDC metadata tables  

•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Clinical.case_barcode` / `case_gdc_id` : patient identifier, used to join to Annotations and file tables  
•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Clinical.disease_code` : restrict to BRCA  
•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Clinical.gender` : restrict to FEMALE  
•  `TCGA_bioclin_v0.Clinical.age_at_diagnosis` : restrict ≤ 30 (years)  

•  `isb-cgc.GDC_metadata.rel14_fileData_current.associated_entities__case_id` (or `cases__case_id`) : links every file to the case UUID  
•  `isb-cgc.GDC_metadata.rel14_fileData_current.file_id` : file UUID to be mapped to a URL  
•  `isb-cgc.GDC_metadata.rel14_GDCfileID_to_GCSurl_NEW.file_gdc_id` / `file_gdc_url` : maps file UUID ➜ Google‑Cloud‑Storage URL  

Typical conditions we will need  

```
entity_type = 'Patient'
(category = 'History of unacceptable prior treatment related to a prior/other malignancy'
     OR classification = 'Redaction')
UPPER(gender) = 'FEMALE'
disease_code = 'BRCA'
age_at_diagnosis <= 30
```

